{"words": [{"text": "وَٱلَّذِينَ", "translation": "And those"}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "translation": "who disbelieve[d]"}, {"text": "وَكَذَّبُوا۟", "translation": "and deny"}, {"text": "بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ", "translation": "Our Signs"}, {"text": "أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ", "translation": "those"}, {"text": "أَصْحَـٰبُ", "translation": "(are the) companions"}, {"text": "ٱلنَّارِ ۖ", "translation": "(of) the Fire"}, {"text": "هُمْ", "translation": "they"}, {"text": "فِيهَا", "translation": "in it"}, {"text": "خَـٰلِدُونَ", "translation": "(will) abide forever"}], "sahih": "And those who disbelieve and deny Our signs - those will be companions of the Fire; they will abide therein eternally.\""}